    dct:description "\"Conceptual model for gene regulation domain. Covers gene expression processes and involved physical entities (genes, transcription factors). Designed as a DAG with is-a relations, enriched by semantic relations (part-of, participates-in, agent-of, patient-of). Focuses on supporting NLP applications rather than fine-grained classification.\""@en ;
    dct:identifier "bioportal-bootstrep" ;
